        StaticBook("*A small note.*", "[Bandaged hands] Faervel", "Dear Mysterious Doctor,\nI rustled these up, I hope they will be payment enough for your kindness. If you could, I'd love to know the recipe for the potion you made for me, send me a bird.\nFrom Faervel, the elfess with the whip.", ""),
