        StaticBook("[!] Neat Note", "Gravelord Vinzakra", "     To whomever may be reading this, welcome to my abode. Should I not know who you are, it would be in your best interests to turn and leave.\n\n     This place is contaminated with the tainted entity of death. Taming such a ruin will result in the death-\nof many, as well as yourself. \n\n     I do hope the best upon you nonetheless, as my home is your home. I will share with you what has been mine for years, but it will indeed require a taste for blood. ", ""),
