        StaticBook("Book Payment", "l337Ninja", "Lelien Aeleyelsa\n((Eenhoornheid))\n\nOrichalcum\nElements of Alchemy\nOn Mali'aheral\n\nSeth'onn\n((Caelria))\n\nDark Brotherhood,\nHubris V1, Hubris V2, \nParagon Lefor\nBoth have already been payed.\n\nBoth orders are ready\nApollo\n((Seth151))\n\nElem. Alchemy\nSlayer's Journal\nDark Brotherhood\nMathic Code\nOrichalcum\n\n\nPayed\nOrder Given to him\nSven (Technomack)\n\nAll 4 books of alchemy\n(miningtilldeath)\nAll magic books\nAll alchemist books except Intro to Alchemist.\n\nPayed\nOrder prepared\nOrder sent\nDruid Alirya\n((sapphireh2o))\n\nElem. Alchemy\nAlchemy Recipes\n\nPayed\nOrder delievered\nLincia (bulldogsoccer8)\n\nHistory of Magic\nMathic code\nSlayer's Journal\n\nOrder prepared\nPayed\nOrder delievered\nEdric (duckd8)\n\nAll Alchemy books\nAll Magic books except Slayer's Journal\nOn Mali'Aheral\nDark Brotherhood\nCloud temple\nSurvival Guide\nAncient Elves\nDruidism\nThrough the teeth of Hell\nOrder done\nPaid\nAver (ryanheff74)\n\nHistory of Magic\nFundamentals of Alchemy\nOrichalcum\n\nPayed\nOrder prepared\nDelivered by bird\n Athri Elibar'acal [Minuscule_Evil]\n\nMathic code\nOrichalcum\nAll alchemy books except Fundamentals\nBlood of many\nSurvival guide\nDark Brotherhood\nLady Sophie\nHubris I and II\nParagon Lefor\nOn Mali'Aheral\nOld Adunian V1\nDruidism\nEveral\nTeeth of Hell\nKeep walking\n\nPayed\nOrder Prepared\nOrder complete\nVangron (Timelord)\n\nAll magic books but Hydromancy", ""),
        StaticBook("Book Prices", "gaiusmarius8", "  Daeron's Bookstore\n=================== Writing Set: 10m\nEmpty Map: 8m\n\nAsk about a job here if you are in need of minas. Also ask about a book contract if you are interested.\n\nBOOK PRICES BY GENRE:\n>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>\nPoetry:\n\nPoetry, 10m\nby: Sofetios Jayamen\n\nImmoral, 10m\nby: Sofetios Jayamen\n\nCanzone, 15m\nby: Hath Roger Wight\nPoetry:\nAdventure:\n\nA Game of Minds C1, C2, C3, 10m each\nby: Sofetios Jayamen\n\nA Tale of Thieves: Vunlir #1, 20m\nby: Daeron Vullir'Sulii\n\nYorhahan's Hill, 25m\nby: Quavinir Signus\nAdventure:\n\nThe Jayan C1, 15m\nby: Sofetios Jayaman\n(Book of the Month!)\nAdventure:\nPhilosiphy:\n\nMelunis the Mad, 15m\nby: Sofetios Jayamen\n\nInformative:\n\nBasics: Aspects, 10m\nby: Daeron Vullir'Sulii\n\nBasics: Elven Tongue, Free to all Mali\nby: Daeron Vullir'Sulii\n\nThe Affliction, 20m\nby: Inforum Populi\n\nInformative:\n\nThe Accomplice #1, 15m\nby: D. (?) (Any info. on this author is appreciated.)\n\n\nInformative:\nHistory:\n\nThe Flagship: Vol. XII, 65m\nby: Ebs Telrunya\n\nVerdan's Journal, 50m\nby: Grand Druid Verdan\n\nThe Servants... 35m\nby: Monk Scribes\nHistory:\n\nBrief history of the         Hightowers, 30m\nby: Everius Hightower\nHorror?:\n\nOdd Events C1. C2, 10m ea\nby: Sofetios Jayamen", ""),
