        StaticBook("Clue Five", "Aptrotta", "Ya found it! Congratulations! Want to sit down for an ale to celebrate or keep going? Ya' still 'ave not found tae treasure but ya' can drink if ya want. If ya' choose to keep looking here is ya' clue\n\n--------->\nGot to sleep but cant go home. Wife and child want to pick a bone. There is only one place left to go. Some says its a secret spot by a stream filled with lovely dreams", ""),
