        StaticBook("Dedicant's Vow", "Tristanm1", "I will walk the forest with my new kin, I will swim the river of truth, wherever it takes me. As the trees watch over us, I shall watch over others in need, I will help preserve the balance, even as dusk approaches,\nI vow to uphold my duties as a Dedicant of the Druidic Order.", ""),
