        StaticBook("Gifts", "MrGreene_HD", "To Daniel Kamura,\n\nMy time in these lands has ended and you, as my great nephew are the one I choose to trust. I have decided to gift you with some materials for your keep along with armour, arms and brews to help the knights in the near \nnear future. Along with all this I  have decided to gift you the sum of 10,000 minas which is hidden within this chest.\n\nLive long with honor,\n\n- Hiroshi Ishikawa", ""),
        StaticBook("Glowing Letter", "RHcrow", "\n===================\n\n*The ink glows a faint orange *\n\nTo King Elendil\n\nFrom Gestahl VonSchlichten\n\nKing Elendil,\n\nOur markets are in search of Redstone lamps to open our theatre in Gallmore.\n\nDo you know where if we could import 5 blocks of Redstone lamps if you know a merchant available?\nAlso, Thank you for visiting Gallmore and helping to ambush those pirates.  It is good to know even the king is willing to draw his blade for Gallmore.\n\nBest Wishes.\n\nGestahl VonSchlichten\n*The ink glows for 3 days after opening*", ""),
