        StaticBook("God Vithquar", "Jistuma", "A book about the future of the great empire of Vithquar, goddess of Evil and Terror.\nAs the legends say, Vithquar the sexy is the one that will rule the realms. Under her feet, millions of sinners will be corpses. Only those that believe and worship her, shall be spared to do her commands. And they will, willingly, and gratefully to\nalways do as she wishes. Some will torture the sinners and kill them all, others will simply exist to please the goddess Vithquar.\n\nVithquar, with extreme beauty, is also a great fighter, the smartest being on the realm, and can fly like\nthe great birds. All that she can't do is swim, because all those of pure evil can not swim, that is for the sinners.", ""),
        StaticBook("God's Commands", "Cheese Servant", "\n\n\n\n     The God's\n     Commands\n\n*Once you open the book, a scent of cheese might just overwhelm your nostrils. (Cheese has been rubbed into the bindings)*\n1) Sacrifice 8.5 pounds of cheese to the Cheese God. Do so in a public area.\n\n2) Bathe yourself in milk.\n\n3) Kiss each cow's muzzle in respect for their milky sacrifice to the God.\n4) Pledge to the Almighty Cheese God that you shall never eat beef.\n\n5) Construct a statue of the Cheese God made out of, of course, cheese.\n\n6) Convert someone to the Cheesy beliefs.\n\n\n\n\n   IF YOU DO NOT\n    FOLLOW THE\n   CHEESE GOD'S\n     COMMANDS:\n   THERE SHALL\n     BE CHEESY\n   CONCEQUENCES", ""),
