        StaticBook("ID.CARD - AL", "onm224", "##@################@##      IDENTIFICATION\n            CARD\n\n\n     GRIFFIN JANIUS\n         \n         TEACHER\n\nSignature:       Signature:\n[Griffin J.]     {@AL@}\n\nkjsdskdj07/02/2014dskdjskj\n Theronn Light my         Flames        \n\n\"One who cheats the Gods shall not go unpunished.\"  \nthe power of Heartfire.  Through this, he gained the love of the people and so they named him, \"The King who was blessed by Thrønn\".\nwith ancient symbols and words.  However, these symbols and words were not of the Lost Tongue and the meanings to the symbols were never written down, only to be faded away in the minds of the people.  The staff is used in many myths and legends,\npossibly one of the greatest artifacts we have to this day.", ""),
