        StaticBook("Invitation", "Secretary of the Magistrate", "\n\n\n\n\n\n     Invitation\n\nKaelthes Tennallar,\n\nCongratulations, your request to join the Magistrate has been reviewed and would like to invite you to attend a meeting with High Magister Kalameet Izalith.\n\nYou will be required to bring a resume regarding all your magical knowledge and experiences, along with a thoroughly thought-out reason why the Magistrate should accept you into such a line of work.\n\nWe would like to once again congratulate you for taking the first step to becoming one of Anthos’ greatest magical users.\n\n- Secretary of the Magistrate", ""),
        StaticBook("Invitation.", "[Masked/Muffled] \"Mad Doctor\"", "This is a formal invitation to lunch at my new manor, a house warming meal if you will. It is to happen in exactly 45 Elven minutes, attend if you wish.", ""),
        StaticBook("Iron Aquifer", "blackhawk77g", "The property as follows is henceforth the property of Dun Irongut. Two prime shops constructed by Dun Irongut at the Iron Aquifer's entrance. Two warehouses constructed by Dun Irongut at the Iron Aquifer's entrance. \nThe property as follows is of Toveah Goldman's. -This page is null and void-\nThe property as follows is now in the hands of the kingdom\nThe property as follows is now in the hands of \"Jak:\" The Tavern and Inn and the Small Shop stall.\nThe appartments remain in ownership by the kingdom, as does the dock. \nThe Irongrinders own and have purchased a clan hall here as well.", ""),
        StaticBook("Ishikawa Brewing", "Charoodler", "===================\n\n\n\n            Ishikawa\n         Brewing Guide\n\n\n\n\nBy Tetsuzaru Ryu\n\n==================\n===================           Ikitsugi Sake\n\nDirections:\n1. Get one bowl of fruit Barley and one apple or carrot.\n\n2. Fill the Cauldron near the top with water\n\n3. Juice the apple or carrot into a liquid\n4. Pour and mix the Barley into the Water\n\n5.Then add the apple or carrot juice into the Cauldron.\n\n6. Mix the contents then let it settle\n\n7. Store the liquids until aged to your liking\n===================           Chosugi Sake\n\nDirections:\n1. Get one bowl of Fruit Barley and a pack of wheat\n\n2. Fill your cauldron to near the top with water\n\n3. Grind the wheat into a powder\n4. Mix the barley into the water\n\n5. Pour the wheat powder into the cauldron\n\n6. Mix the contents and let it settle\n\n7. Store the liquids until aged to your liking\n==================\n===================            Kyosei Sake\n\nDirections:\n1. Get one bowl of Fruit Barley and one Bowl of Oak Leaves\n\n2.  Fill your cauldron to near the top with water\n\n3. Grind the Oak leaves into a powder\n4. Mix the Barley into the water\n\n6. Pour the powder into the cauldron\n\n7. Mix the contents then and let it settle\n\n8. Store  the liquids until aged to your liking\n\n==================", ""),
        StaticBook("Ivan's Diary", "[Sheriff] Geoturgist Khagan", "\nEnetry 1:\nbut im not sure everyone belives me.\nEntry 2:\nthe mountain with a path leading to it out side. also me and Ariana and scared for Alester he has grown  . . . hard. he is totaly unlike the brother i use to know who played with me and Ariana and who was a realy gentle boy. Farthers death has beed hard\non him . . . he slapped me today for making the mess in arianas room. it hurt. you can still see the mark on my cheek. also jonathan has gone on a weeks adventuring somewhere. well thats enough for one enetry.\nEntry 3:\nit was so suprising. Also Jonathan is back from his adventure early and Brother . . . Kissed! yes Kissed Kalina its weird. i feel happy for him having a friend -who isn't one of the guards- but Kalina! why her. also i asked about where babys come from but\nAriana just avoided the question saying she knows nothing . . . i will have to ask Alester when i have time. Well that enough for now i think.\nEntry 4:\nthat if they marry she will be my Sister-In-Law and our family will have grown to 5 again. also when i was in abresi a dark mist decended and one man shouted out there were undead there! it was realy scary so me and Alester ran back to Gren shutting the\ngates. oh! did i mension we are now in the Royal Oren Army and everyone gets a new uniform. also ... there is this girl i like who has a shop there her name is Violet nickname Vi im not sure how she feels about me but we seem to get along well. \nEntry 5:\nto be incharge of this place when Alester is gone, its a big responcibilty and some times gets too much ... i wish Farther was still here he was always there for us ready to give advise or just to generaly be there for us . . . i miss him. i know the\nothers do to but Alester never seems to show it and Ariana keeps all her feelings bottled up so i never know them. Well ... Jakir came back today ... um everythings in confusion Kalina is realy sad and Jakir is being realy weird being all ok about the\nsplit up and Alester hasn't seen him yet i wounder what would happen i hope they don't kill each other  then there will only be 3 of us ... and Ariana or I will have to lead. \nEntry 6:\nits all a bit confusing at the moment \nEntry 7:\nattacked. I thought i was going to die he was sitting ontop of me with his clawed gauntlets on, it was terrifing, but it seems he didn't want to kill me so he knocked me out and draged up to the very top of a cliff or something simaler where he held me\nover the drop his claws pressed agenst my neck and then began to talk ... talk of a secret society called the Sentinals. there\nthough he asked in such a way it was like i had a chouce in the matter. anyway i accepted so after flinging us off the cliff into the river below he lead me to the base where he set me up with a room and everything, its nothing like back at the Barony but\nim content. Now onto the bad. When i was there i found out he was a canable, it was discusting he has a rack in his room full of body parts, anyway he went to make us both stew his ... with his stuff in it, mine with chicken which he oviously didn't like\nprepairing. Anyway when i went to take my bowl off of the table i wasn't looking which i picked up thinking he would put mine closest to me ... I picked up the wrong one i ate. Aculy ate human and elf fleash ... it was the tastiest thing i have ever had.\nIt was so tender and nice ... but horrifing, i am disgusted at myself and what i have become but when ever i now think of dead people my mouth starts watering and my tummy grumbles. In the order i have been placed in the freak squad ... i agree with them.\nIm a monster a horrable creature lead by his gut, for even when i am full i still have this urge to try some more. I hate myself because of it.\nEntry 8:\nEntry 9:\nhad ... that scares me most ... i have become hard, sometimes i feel like i am loosing my mind. i can't remember what happend some days and i feel the need for flesh more and more, I also limped to gren to visit Alester and Ariana they seemed quite happy\nto see me, but i fear i can't hide my condition from Ariana for much longer she knows me too well to know when i am lieing, i fear i shall have to tell her before she finds out another way ... sometimes i have nightmares too, its always the same me, in \nGren all there bodys lieing around me, then i stand up and Ariana is there a hole in her chest her organs on the floor or in my mouth, luckly it is about then i wake up. realise it was another nightmare, it dosn't take the fear away though ... or the tast\nEntry 10:\nwas horrible she kept trying to get away from me she even slaped my hand away when I was trying to reason with her ... None of my family like me the only place i have left to go is the group ... I also started self-harming, cutting on my wrists ... it\nhurt so bad i wanted to die, but i knew i must continue, couldn't let my life be controled by instincts.", ""),
        StaticBook("Jared's Tome", "Jared Blackfoot", "Fire is my body and fire is my blood. I am the hand behind the hammer. I am the steel of the blade. I am Jared Blackfoot, Whitesmith of the Lance.\nwho forges the blades of Xan. Though my hammer the blades fall on the unworthy.", ""),
        StaticBook("Jarita's Journal", "enderholubec", "20th of Snow's  Maiden,1453\nHis name is Rahzan ((or rahzen)) He met when he was pushed into the bath with me and Zaddha, funny. ((He was meant ot be we*)) \ning his face, i walked up to him and asked what was wrong, he was badly beaten, I made him my healing medicine with my special herbs, i don't really regret it, i didn't like seeing him in pain. I can't conrtoll my imagination around him, s\n((replace the \"i\"s with Jarita lewl)\nJarita think Do'Rahzan is avoiding her, haven't seen Rahzan in long time, but, Jarita okay with that, becuase she thinks that he lieks the other one, um, jarita don't know her name...\n [!] This page is blank.\n\nRahzan and  Rameethar got in, and she hid and then, stupid nose achooed, giving her away. Rameether said Tla would be mad at her. She sad.\n[!] The writing is hard to read and there are tear stains and ink splotches, \nIt was not Rahzan who\n[!] One final page has been written in the journal, in much clearer, but different handwriting.", ""),
        StaticBook("Jaromancy Vol. 1", "Kahzo", "      __________\n      \\            /\n      /            \\\n      |              |\n      |              |\n      |              |\n      |              |\n      |              |\n      |              |\n      \\________/\n\n       Jar-omancy\n           Vol. 1\n|||    Chapter No. 1   |||\n  |||                    |||\n    ||   Fortitude   ||        |||                    |||\n|||                        |||\n\nThe strength or durability of the Jar is that of bedrock. It is completely unbreakable and therefore is one\nof the strongest materials known to all of Anthos. If you are trapped in a jar, attempting to break out will just end up breaking your bones. \n\nNo source of magic or weaponry can break the jar as it's made of an unknown material. It is see through similar\nto glass but shares no durability features with glass. The only person to know Jaromancy and the ability to summon jars is the Jar-King Shambo. \n\nMany futile attempts have been made at breaking the jar although none have\nbeen successful. Abresi & Malinor both have paid for a combined project of attempting to break it although the material could never shatter. The project is still ongoing today.\n\nTo this day many mothers have fallen victim to Shambo.", ""),
        StaticBook("Jasper's Diaries", "Domainoft", "Jasper's Diaries\nRetold by Leyu'Maehr\nWondrous Writings\nVaerhaven\n*Strange Numbers\n((9/9/13))\n((These are 3 diaries of a man named Jasper. It follows 20 years of the mans life. As you read you concentrate on the important moments)) The marrige is finally today! I can't wait to move in with my wife to our new house in Al'Khazar.... Our stay in\nthis town has been well accepted.... A weird fellow came to our house today speaking of prophecy, looked a little crazy, but appeared to be a nice person.... so we decided to invite the prophet to lunch today. We learned he is Afonse.... His\nstories are full of life, death and adventure, we don't know if they are true.... Great story teller, but seems like he can't read or write.... Mr. Wilcons doesn't talk to us anymore, the town seems to have started resenting us since we\nbefriended Afonse.... Anna is pregnant! The joy to finally have a son or daughter to call my own.... The undeath have been on my mind of the town folk, they are becoming agitated.... Why, why..why would they kidnap a pregnant woman. Just because\nthey hate Afonse... why Anna? She did nothing wrong!.... She is safe... After I came home after looking for her, she was there... The relief...but Afonse was in bed next to her, gravely wounded. Seems he attacked the kidnapers... all\ndied, Afonse was left with injuries. .... We do not know how long he'll last, he has been weaker each day.... Our son has been named today, Jistuma. Named by his late godfather Afonse, who died today. Named after Afonse's god of judgment, to give\nblessing to our son and to himself recieve good fortune in death. Haven't seen Anna cry since the death of his brother. Her tears seemed green like her eyes. Rest in peace Afonse.... the king came to our house today, the treats from the town are\nbig, and they want us death. They take the kidnapers side, how dare they? The king decided to exile us, as to please the town, and to save our lives.... we were given the belongings of Afonse.... They said he had a will..... The king was good, sent a\nhealer to our home in the wild to give birth to our son..... I found a book in Afonse's belongings, seems to be about his religion. ..... It talks about sacrifices and death to pleast their masters. I don't know if Afonse knew about this.... But then I\ntalked to the king about it. He told me Afonse was an orphan, picked up by an evil man that showed himself as a father to him. Started teaching him his religion. but as something good, to ease the transition into evil... But as a criminal he died\nsoon, and left Afonse with an evil religion. That he taught was good..... As I read the book, I found out that Jistuma was an elf from the past, a former disciple, that carried the task of judging the souls of the believers.... Today is Jistuma's 10th\nbirthday, I can't believe how happy he is in the wilds. befriends animals from the forest, and all the traders from all races seem to like him, even the orcs for some reason.... He got angrier and attacked his mother. I do not know why. Now he is crying\nand remembers the events differantly. What has happened? .... Anna died... The boy cried a lot... It isn't his fault.... The druids can't figure out why Jistuma has been so angry and attacking everything. I fear he might be possessed. A more powreful\ndruid will come. Freight and anger make my son lose control. He is possessed by a demon, and the demon is wise. After taking control and attacking, he gives my son new memories. The druid taught me how to make a potion to ease the\ndemon, but even with this, If his feelings get really strong, the demon might take control... What will I do?..... Jistuma makes 18 years of age today! I can't believe how good he is at catching animals and monsters, and I'm very hapy that he sees all\nraces the same. He even sees all man the same. good and evil... I don't like that much, I deal with the black market for ingrediants for his potion. And sometimes they come to my house... I can still remember the time an undeath came. I was frighten to\ndeath, but Jistuma started casually talking to him like he was any other person.... he has been bugging me to let him travel..... I need to tell him about the demon. I think I'll take him to the druid so he can tell him with more detail. This way, he\ncan start to shut up about the travels... ((The last written pages of the diary are written in blood, the words get messy sometimes and drops of blood are everywhere. but its still understandable.)) We were attacked outside of\nAl'Khazar. We didn't noticed we wer surroudned by monsters. I got close to getting hurt by them, but Jistuma saved me. Oly to slash my stomach in the next second. HIs eyes were yellow! He quickly regained control, but he was apologizing on how\nhe couldn't stop the monsters in time. His eyes were losing the green from this mother and are gaining some red. He's taken me to Al'Khazar, but when someone tries to help me. He doesn't let them pass and shouts and screams. 'Why do you want to kill\nhim, that was so long ago, just hekp him please just help him'. The demon is distorting his reality. ((This is the last page of the diary. It's also written in blood, and there are marks that seem to be from tears, but the color on the spots are\ngreen.)) I am approaching death. My son left me for a bit so I could be alone to pray for Anna. Son, if you learn to read and see this, please know that I don't blame Al'Khazar, I do not blame Afonse, and I do not blame you. And remember, your\nmother Anna loved you, and I Jasper, love you as well.", ""),
        StaticBook("Jasper's Diaries", "Oracle", "Jasper's Diaries\n\nRetold by Leyu'Maehr\n\nOracle Library\n*Strange Numbers\n((9/19/13))\n((These are 3 diaries of a man named Jasper. It follows 20 years of the mans life. As you read you concentrate on the important moments)) The marrige is finally today! I can't wait to move in with my wife to our new house in Al'Khazar.... Our stay in\nthis town has been well accepted.... A weird fellow came to our house today speaking of prophecy, looked a little crazy, but appeared to be a nice person.... so we decided to invite the prophet to lunch today. We learned he is Afonse.... His\nstories are full of life, death and adventure, we don't know if they are true.... Great story teller, but seems like he can't read or write.... Mr. Wilcons doesn't talk to us anymore, the town seems to have started resenting us since we\nbefriended Afonse.... Anna is pregnant! The joy to finally have a son or daughter to call my own.... The undeath have been on my mind of the town folk, they are becoming agitated.... Why, why..why would they kidnap a pregnant woman. Just because\nthey hate Afonse... why Anna? She did nothing wrong!.... She is safe... After I came home after looking for her, she was there... The relief...but Afonse was in bed next to her, gravely wounded. Seems he attacked the kidnapers... all\ndied, Afonse was left with injuries. .... We do not know how long he'll last, he has been weaker each day.... Our son has been named today, Jistuma. Named by his late godfather Afonse, who died today. Named after Afonse's god of judgment, to give\nblessing to our son and to himself recieve good fortune in death. Haven't seen Anna cry since the death of his brother. Her tears seemed green like her eyes. Rest in peace Afonse.... the king came to our house today, the treats from the town are\nbig, and they want us death. They take the kidnapers side, how dare they? The king decided to exile us, as to please the town, and to save our lives.... we were given the belongings of Afonse.... They said he had a will..... The king was good, sent a\nhealer to our home in the wild to give birth to our son..... I found a book in Afonse's belongings, seems to be about his religion. ..... It talks about sacrifices and death to pleast their masters. I don't know if Afonse knew about this.... But then I\ntalked to the king about it. He told me Afonse was an orphan, picked up by an evil man that showed himself as a father to him. Started teaching him his religion. but as something good, to ease the transition into evil... But as a criminal he died\nsoon, and left Afonse with an evil religion. That he taught was good..... As I read the book, I found out that Jistuma was an elf from the past, a former disciple, that carried the task of judging the souls of the believers.... Today is Jistuma's 10th\nbirthday, I can't believe how happy he is in the wilds. befriends animals from the forest, and all the traders from all races seem to like him, even the orcs for some reason.... He got angrier and attacked his mother. I do not know why. Now he is crying\nand remembers the events differantly. What has happened? .... Anna died... The boy cried a lot... It isn't his fault.... The druids can't figure out why Jistuma has been so angry and attacking everything. I fear he might be possessed. A more powreful\ndruid will come. Freight and anger make my son lose control. He is possessed by a demon, and the demon is wise. After taking control and attacking, he gives my son new memories. The druid taught me how to make a potion to ease the\ndemon, but even with this, If his feelings get really strong, the demon might take control... What will I do?..... Jistuma makes 18 years of age today! I can't believe how good he is at catching animals and monsters, and I'm very hapy that he sees all\nraces the same. He even sees all man the same. good and evil... I don't like that much, I deal with the black market for ingrediants for his potion. And sometimes they come to my house... I can still remember the time an undeath came. I was frighten to\ndeath, but Jistuma started casually talking to him like he was any other person.... he has been bugging me to let him travel..... I need to tell him about the demon. I think I'll take him to the druid so he can tell him with more detail. This way, he\ncan start to shut up about the travels... ((The last written pages of the diary are written in blood, the words get messy sometimes and drops of blood are everywhere. but its still understandable.)) We were attacked outside of\nAl'Khazar. We didn't noticed we wer surroudned by monsters. I got close to getting hurt by them, but Jistuma saved me. Oly to slash my stomach in the next second. HIs eyes were yellow! He quickly regained control, but he was apologizing on how\nhe couldn't stop the monsters in time. His eyes were losing the green from this mother and are gaining some red. He's taken me to Al'Khazar, but when someone tries to help me. He doesn't let them pass and shouts and screams. 'Why do you want to kill\nhim, that was so long ago, just hekp him please just help him'. The demon is distorting his reality. ((This is the last page of the diary. It's also written in blood, and there are marks that seem to be from tears, but the color on the spots are\ngreen.)) I am approaching death. My son left me for a bit so I could be alone to pray for Anna. Son, if you learn to read and see this, please know that I don't blame Al'Khazar, I do not blame Afonse, and I do not blame you. And remember, your\nmother Anna loved you, and I Jasper, love you as well.", ""),
