        StaticBook("Letter", "RHcrow", "Arzota,\nto secure gallmore's safety in our early future. I perhaps thought it appropriate to commision an artist to paint your likeness and hang the portrait on the walls of the\nMy painter isnt available for an elven day but if you are interested please send me a bird back.", ""),
        StaticBook("Letter", "Vaereroes", "Greetings to you, Richard Tarus.  This may be to much to ask, however, recently I had a staff made for I out of meteorite, and mage gold.  As I realized the magegold did not effect my magical abilities at all, it came to my concern. If you have anyone who\ncould possibly enchant this staff, I will reward them with meteorite, and perhaps more. Please reply as soon as possible. \n\n~Denfather Vaerus\nThe Silver Siren\nDear Scarlet", ""),
        StaticBook("Letter", "Darkdragon274", "Nienna-\n\nApparently lyweneth led Eventa out of the base to Leanniel since we had gone there. Then she returned on her own when we were absent.\n\nIt worries me that somebody let her out. She's safe, though.", ""),
        StaticBook("Letter", "Rosso", "((To Hooded Elf))\n\nYour minion has been captured by Princess Titania, they are in the barracks at the moment. The minion is the dark elf with the pink hair.\n", ""),
        StaticBook("Letter", "spartansoldier8", "Hey ienna, do you have a couple of new brews already ? If you do, contact me, and tell me were to meet you to test them, since you ain't around Ac'Talareh right now\n\nDrake.\n\n", ""),
        StaticBook("Letter", "Domainoft", "-A neatly written letter is before you, written in neat calligraphy. Before opening the letter, the seal of House Horen would be broken.- \n\nDear Roland\nThank you for your kind letter. It was lovely to read and was a pleasant surprise.  \nI trust you are well and that the time it has been since your last letter has been kind to you.\n\nThank you for your company at my /brother's/ ball. It was lovely to speak with someone my own age. As well, please know that should you \nneed any help - looking for your sister or with anything else, i will be more than happy to oblige. \n\nI hope we see each other again. You hold pleasant company and make me smile. \nMay the creator guide your path \nSophia -", ""),
        StaticBook("Letter", "Kaelys Kaden Hightower", "I tried to forgive you. I honestly did. I wanted to forgive you more then you likely wanted to be forgiven.\nBecause just that day you ran off with him.\nBut it bothers me to know he got to put his disgusting hands on you.\nIf you wanted to go to the North, I could have taken you to the north. \nAnd that he's defiled you, I do not think we ever will be. \nAnd sorry simply isn't enough.\nYou told me you wanted him to leave, but this isn't true is it?\nI loved you sera, I really did, even after you walked away from me as my eye bled out I still loved you.", ""),
        StaticBook("LETTER", "'Neu'", "Criminal in Abresi, come to the stairs by the entrance now, Vex!\n\n-Neu!", ""),
        StaticBook("Letter", "Lord Alester Herenden", "Dear Ivan\n\nIf you do not recant your ways and return to Gren, swearing full loyalty to me and this house, you will be officially disowned.\nYou have three elven days to reply.", ""),
        StaticBook("Letter", "[Unhooded] Edmure Parkins", "Olivier,\n\nYour services are needed. Meet at Nations Crossing immediately.\n\n~Edmure", "")
