        StaticBook("Menu", "Sofetios", "\n    Sofetios's Fiction\n      Bookstore and\n        Restaurant\n\n\n  ,.-:-'THE MENU'-:-,.\n\n(( \"((RP))\" means that it will be served RP'ing. Not as an actual item.))\n        ~Drinks~\n\nAles:\n\nSwift Recovery Stout\n\nDescription: Our best ale! This ale is known for its ability to liven up the drinker as well and make them feel better then normal.\nCOST: 8 Minas\nSwimmer's Ale\n\nDescription: This ale helps the drinker relax. It even helps you breath better when you are sick.\nCOST: 6 Minas\nMending Ale\n\nDescription: This ale helps people recover from exaustion. Almost the same as Swift Recovory Stout, but more mild.\nCOST: 4 Minas\nNon-Alcoholic Drinks\n\nWater\n\nDescription: Water, boiled to make it more clean and then cooled inside kegs. ((RP))\nCOST: Free\nHerbal Tea\n\nDescription: A herbal tea made wake the drinker up more.((RP))\nCOST: 2 Minas\n\nSweet Tea\n\nDescription: Sweet tea made to help the drinker relax. ((RP))\nCOST: 2 Minas\n         ~Food~\n\nFresh Baked Bread\n\nDescription: A loaf of fresh bread that is soft on the inside, and slightly crunchy on the outside.\nCOST: 1 Mina\nSlices of Sweet Melon\n\nDescription: Four large slices of sweet watermelon.\nCOST: 1 Mina\n\nFresh Carrots\n\nDescription: Three crunchy carrots, home grown.\nCOST: 1 Mina\nBaked Potato\n\nDescription: A baked potato, cut open in the middle and ready for eating!\nCost: 1 Mina\n\nOven Roasted Chicken\n\nDescription: An oven roasted chicken with crispy skin and spices baked on it.\nCOST: 2 Minas\n\n\nSteak\n\nDescription: A large, prime cut of beef, cooked with herbs for more flavor.\nCOST: 2 Minas\nPorkchop\n\nDescription: A large cut of pork cooked with herbs and spices.\nCOST: 2 Minas\n       ~Dessert~\n\nSweet Pumpkin Pie\n\nDescription: A piece of sweet pumpkin pie, made from all fresh ingredients.\nCOST: 2 Minas\nChocolate Chip Cookies\n\nDescription: Four fresh baked chocolate chip cookies.\nCost: 1 Mina\nCake\n\nDescription: A skillfully baked cake with sweet, creamy frosting and strawberries on top.\nCOST: 5 Minas\nThank you for stopping at Sofetios's Fiction Bookstore and Restaurant! I hope to see you again soon!\n\nPlease remember to give back any mugs or menus you have after you are done.\n\n~Sofetios Jayamen", ""),
        StaticBook("Menu", "Sofetios Jayamen", "        Sofetios's\n    Fiction Bookstore\n     and Restaurant\n\n     ,.-:-'MENU'-:-.,\n\n\n         Drinks\n\nAll drinks cost 3 Minas! (Excluding water, which is free)\n\nFarmer's Stout\n\nDiscription: A Fruity ale made to give energy to the drinker.\nSunset Ale\n\nDescription: A sweet tasting ale made to relax the drinker.\n\nMinor's Vigor\n\nDescription: A wheat based ale that is slightly bitter.\nSweet Tea\n\nDescription: A sweet herbal tea, made to give energy to the drinker.\n\nHerbal Tea\n\nDescription: A slightly tasty tea, made for the drinker to relax.\nWater\n\nDescription: Water, boiled first to make it more clean, then cooled in barrels.\n           Food\n\nAll food is 1 Mina!\n\nFresh Baked Bread\n\nDescription: A loaf of bread that is soft on the inside and slightly crunchy on the outside!\nSlices of Sweet Melon\n\nDecription: Four large slices of sweet melon!\n\nOven Roasted Chicken\n\nDesription: An Oven Roasted Chicken with crispy skin and some herbs and spices baked on it!\nBaked Potato\n\nDescription: A Baked potato, cut open in the middle and ready for eating!\n\nFresh Carrots\n\nDescription: Three crunchy carrots, home grown!\nSweet Pumpkin Pie\n\nDescription: A slice of sweet pumpkin pie, made from all fresh ingrediants!\n\nChocolate Chip Cookies \nDescription: Four fresh baked chocolate chip cookies!\nCake\n\nDescription: A skillfully baked cake with sweet creamy frosting and strawberries on top! This food item costs five minas.\nThank you for stopping at Sofetios's Fiction Bookstore and Restaurant! \n\nPlease remember to give back your mugs!\n\nI hope to see you again soon!\n\n~Sofetios Jayamen", ""),
