        StaticBook("Specials", "ZeroMasterZx", " \"Hero's Beginning\"  \nMonday\n\nHero's Drink Steak, 2 melons , 3 baked potatoes and 4 cookies 30 minas\n\"Ice Dance\" \nTues\nDiamond Dust  2 fish 2 breads 3 carrots 2 cookies 2 cookies 27 minas\n\nFruity Sensation\nWeds\n\" Liberi Fatali 2 chickens 3 apples 4 melons 1 pie 25 minas \n\nSweet Desires\" \nThursday\nDivine Passion 2 steak 4 breads 3 carrots 3 cookies 30 minas \n\n\"Moonlight Night \nfriday\nWaltz on the Moon 3 chickens 4 breads 2 carrots 5 cookies 27 minas\n\nFeed The Beast\nSaturday\nUltima 5 steaks 3 fishes 3 carrots 4 baked potatoes 5 cookies and 8 melons 65 minas\nLife's Stream\nSunday\nCactuar 2 fish 3 apples 4 potatoes 6 cookies 20", ""),
