        StaticBook("Task A", "Daeron", "Your friend is either\n\nA; Pinkies military\nB: Bowmen military\nC: Beard military\n\nCollect wares on them and put it in a book. Does not have to be coded, but code parts you deem to be important. Will have a party next elven week\nregarding collected information. When deemed finished, put book on wares within a chest. Specify location. ((Coords)) \n\n((Dead drop book at whereever you deem proper. Prefer the wilds)) ", ""),
