        StaticBook("Teerz contract", "Bloodnight", "* The Contract For *\n\nThis binding contract signifies that Sha(Teerz) and an unnamed investor (vice7) have offically purchased property rights to the stables. \n                                     For a total fee of 2200 on inital signing, plus a fee of \n300 due every week, they have agreed to the terms listed before. \n\nI, Azaghal Rareksson, \nThe Grand Merchant of the Dwarven Kingdom \noffically sanction this purchase, and list it as a national act.\n\n*A golden stamp*", ""),
        StaticBook("Teeth of Hell", "Domainoft", "Through The Teeth of Hell\n-Retold by Leyu'Maehr\nVaehaven\n*Strange Numbers\n((3/3/13))\nHarold Fergensun, and Orc, was walking down a stone road. Pretending he was innocent. You see, Harold was a robber, rapist, murderer, just to name a few. Then...... he was shot by gaurds. Arrow in his back, Harold dropped to his knees, and died.\nSwirling shapes and figures rushed around him. He landed, in the stone of Hell. Crying, yelling, death, all 'round. He saw above him the teeth of hell. He started climbing, and saw his friend Lucas, burning , pleading for him to help. But he said \"I\ncannot help\". He climbed further. He then saw his father, begging for salvation. Harold again says, I cannot help. He climbs almost to the top. ALMOST THERE AND- his wife. His dead wife. \"Help me Harold, I love you!\" Harold couldnt resis t. \"I love you\ntoo but.....\" he looked down. \"I must help you all\" He drags all the earlier mentioned friends through the teeth of hell. He asks them, \"Why were you there?\" They said \"Because of you....\". He told them he was sorry, and knew what to do. He jumped back\nin. He saved his friends from hell, and sacrificed himself. He the heard the voice of God calling him up while he was grinding in the teeth of Hell. God said \"You have sacrificed yourself for others. You are redeemed\" He was saved from the Nether and\nbrought up to heaven. There he saw the people he just rescued, and many more. The Cathaldus family the Harronis family, and many more. He was at peace with God, and Aegis. THE END.", ""),
        StaticBook("Teeth of Hell", "Leyu", "Through The Teeth of Hell\n\nRetold by Leyu'Maehr\n\n30th of the Deep Cold 1448\n\nA gift for King Heinrik Carrion I\nHarold Fergensun, and Orc, was walking down a stone road. Pretending he was innocent. You see, Harold was a robber, rapist, murderer, just to name a few. Then...... he was shot by gaurds. Arrow in his back, Harold dropped to his knees, and died.\nSwirling shapes and figures rushed around him. He landed, in the stone of Hell. Crying, yelling, death, all 'round. He saw above him the teeth of hell. He started climbing, and saw his friend Lucas, burning , pleading for him to help. But he said \"I\ncannot help\". He climbed further. He then saw his father, begging for salvation. Harold again says, I cannot help. He climbs almost to the top. ALMOST THERE AND- his wife. His dead wife. \"Help me Harold, I love you!\" Harold couldnt resis t. \"I love you\ntoo but.....\" he looked down. \"I must help you all\" He drags all the earlier mentioned friends through the teeth of hell. He asks them, \"Why were you there?\" They said \"Because of you....\". He told them he was sorry, and knew what to do. He jumped back\nin. He saved his friends from hell, and sacrificed himself. He the heard the voice of God calling him up while he was grinding in the teeth of Hell. God said \"You have sacrificed yourself for others. You are redeemed\" He was saved from the Nether and\nbrought up to heaven. There he saw the people he just rescued, and many more. The Cathaldus family the Harronis family, and many more. He was at peace with God, and Aegis. THE END.", ""),
        StaticBook("Teeth of Hell", "Oracle", "Through The Teeth of Hell\n-Retold by Leyu'Maehr\n\n\nOracle Library\n*Strange Numbers\n((9/19/13))\nHarold Fergensun, and Orc, was walking down a stone road. Pretending he was innocent. You see, Harold was a robber, rapist, murderer, just to name a few. Then...... he was shot by gaurds. Arrow in his back, Harold dropped to his knees, and died.\nSwirling shapes and figures rushed around him. He landed, in the stone of Hell. Crying, yelling, death, all 'round. He saw above him the teeth of hell. He started climbing, and saw his friend Lucas, burning , pleading for him to help. But he said \"I\ncannot help\". He climbed further. He then saw his father, begging for salvation. Harold again says, I cannot help. He climbs almost to the top. ALMOST THERE AND- his wife. His dead wife. \"Help me Harold, I love you!\" Harold couldnt resis t. \"I love you\ntoo but.....\" he looked down. \"I must help you all\" He drags all the earlier mentioned friends through the teeth of hell. He asks them, \"Why were you there?\" They said \"Because of you....\". He told them he was sorry, and knew what to do. He jumped back\nin. He saved his friends from hell, and sacrificed himself. He the heard the voice of God calling him up while he was grinding in the teeth of Hell. God said \"You have sacrificed yourself for others. You are redeemed\" He was saved from the Nether and\nbrought up to heaven. There he saw the people he just rescued, and many more. The Cathaldus family the Harronis family, and many more. He was at peace with God, and Aegis. THE END.", ""),
        StaticBook("Telrenya's Note", "TheRealKiru", "* The note appears to be in an elegant form of handwriting belonging to a mali'aheral*\n\nDear Tanith,\n\nYou may not remember me, but I've just met your son. He's a very polite and handsome valah. I'm sure he \nshall be breaking his first heart soon. I write this note to thank you for all that you did many years ago. A small elf girl was brought to the Rose stronghold. She met with you and your husband, Baldir. Her name was Telrenya and she showed respect for \nthe two Valah, despite being offered none by other members there. Again, I'm not sure if you remember, but I had brown hair, blue eyes and had a green cloak wrapped around me. \n\nIf you do not, then I will not pester you any longer. I wish you and\nyour family the best.\n\n~ Telrenya", ""),
        StaticBook("Telver's Journal", "cococococo11", "The First Guard's Journal of Cole Telver ((February 23- March 1))\n\nFebruary23- Did about 20 elvish minutes of patrolling\n\nFebruary 24- Did my first gate duty, a shift of about 10 minutes\n\nFebruary 25-Did some more patrolling.\n\nFebruary 26- A little patrolling and putting someone in jail for pushing someone off of a roof.\n\nFebruary 27- PAtrolling and 5 elvish minutes of Gate duty\n\nFebruary 28- Even more patrolling \n\nMarch 1- Watched gate for a few elvish minutes.", ""),
        StaticBook("Temple Scholar", "Irene42", "A man washed up on shore today, He was very tired and bound by metal cuffs to his wrists. \nWhen asked if he needed help he refused to speak to me and shook his bound hands at me.\nAfter a short time he became quite upset\nand began to chew at his wrists. He had clearly gone mad but I was no match for his brawn, I could not stop him. He had removed his hands with his own teeth.\nIn the end the man bled to death but in his last moments, after the cuffs had fallen off he \nfinally spoke \"Thank the gods, I'm free\" \n\nAfter further study of these cuffs I have decided that they are unsafe and shall hide them.\n\nTo find this treasure you will need to fight your fears, but hold on dear! to\nfind this treasure look far, look near but in the end you will have to drown in your tears.", ""),
        StaticBook("Tending Grapes", "Domainoft", "Tending Grapes\nTable of Contents:\nChapter One: Selecting a proper site for your Grapes.\nGrapes prefer to have plenty of sunlight so be sure to grow them in a place that wont be shaded for\nusing coca seed shells or Melon rines are a good way to help give them the\nthere is no need to worry about bees or other animals to help them\nas in Very warm Orcish climates try a NorthEast-SouthEast\nimporant to help prevent this. One way to reduce the amount of disease is to plant\nwell too. Also planting your\nChapter Two: How to plant grape vines.\nFor the best results try planting your vines in the Spring. If you can't plant them immediately it\nthem in water for a few hours just before. Make sure to have your vine supports\nplants and about half a Dwarven foot to a\nall the flower clusters the first season. The goal with the first year is to\nthe roots directly not through a spray. The roots are very shallow early on and will need a lot of water, but take care not to over water as you'll see the leaves start droping. Also, mulching is not necessary after the vines are established.\nChapter Three: Fertilizer, Weeds, and Pruning.\nFertilizer can play an important role in the health of your grapes. Although it is likely not\nand produce less fruit. It is also important that you don't fertilize the soil to\nexperimentation with the\nweeds as soon as you find them.\nfreeze,\nfoot of trunk length on the vine. Balanced pruning means balancing next season's crop with last\nprevious growing season. Wood two years and older is not counted or\ngrapes picked and prunings removed to prevent overwintering of insect larvae.\nChapter Four: Birds, Bugs, Bears O My! Protect your Grapes.\nBirds love grapes. Netting is the most effective solution to prevent birds from consuming your\nsquirrels, rabbits, Zombie pigmen, and Spiders. A strong defenseive site can provide\nany rotting fruit quickly to protect yourself\nhang. Table grapes are left on the vine longer than wine\nenough to harvest. Pick\nfor a longer storage life. Do not pile the harvest to deep to avoid crushing\nup soil around the base of the vine. After the fall leaves drop and vines are dormate, prune the\nthe vines with dirt,\nwinter killed vines to soon. The roots might survive and send up new shoots.\nI hope you find this guide helpful, and I look forward to tasting your sweet grapes.\n~Master Gardener *The name seems to be smudged in dirt and is unreadable.", ""),
