        StaticBook("Treasury Permit", "Z3r05t4r", "Official Decree of\ngiven Powers of the\nTreasurer's Hand.\n\nThe individual named\nTuv, Chivay by blood and descendant of Goldman is hereby granted following:\n\nFull range of powers of the Lord High Treasurer.\nExceptions are following:\n1. May not appoint other hands.\n2. May not appoint any officers of the treasury.\n3. Shall not participate in council meetings unless requested.\n4. May not harm the treasury or the nation in any way or face\nthe biggest penalty for mortal beings. Death.\n\nThis is an official permit, granted by the Lord High Treasurer\nSilus Iullius Horen\nRoyal Prince of Oren\n\n-+-+-+-+-+-+-+-+-+-", ""),
