        StaticBook("Undead", "Kalesta", "Undead\n\nRetold by Kalesta\n\nOracle's Library\n\n19th of Sun's Smile\n-1446\nBanished to a different realm of existence for all eternity, Iblees counted the years away, feeding on the souls that would drift into his plane after death. It was just a matter of time until the opprotunity arose for revenge.\n             -Unknown", ""),
