        StaticBook("Working on evos", "[unhooded] Rowin Dane", "I have been focusing on fire evocation. I have been advancing at a steady pace learning how to control the flame and heat. I spen a lot of timme in the void controling the flame from a tourch i have lit in my basement. I move it, controle it, and give it \npropultion at a homeade target. It is becomeing easier and easier to work with the flame and heat. I have understood the meanings of the void. I see that it is not just blacknes but it is the connections o the univers all togeather and the \nplace were anything and everything resides. It is the connection between everything.\n\nI am becomeing more powerful in the arts of water and fire evocation and I am seeking a master to help me advance. I am also going to learn\nLightning evocation to become more destruction to be able to hold my own in battle. ", ""),
        StaticBook("Working Pass", "CCCP_Zhulik", "Working Pass:\nPeople: Arden and Sarah\n\nWork: Medical Treatments and Medical Research.\n\nDuration: One Elven Year\n\nArden\nSarah Archdiamond", ""),
        StaticBook("Worldly Shapes", "P.Y. Thagorus", "We, as descendants of the ancients, have been travelling from continent, to continent; island to island, for the past two thousand years. In this time, no geographical survey or voyage has been ventured succesfully so that there is an accurate length\nand width to our world. It has been, many times postulated, that the world simply will hang off into the void at one point, and nothingness will exist following that. It has also been postualed that the world is, quite ridiculously, a sphere. This notion \nis by far the most imbecilic way to propose a theory on the shape of the world. Some have even suggested, that there is no shape at all, and that it is simply the materialization of the thoughts of Angels and Demons (the traditional spelling is far too\nguttural, for my tastes), and we are just as an allegory to their minds.\n\nI, however, have taken the more scientific approach. Note, that when the sun is just at the horizon, there is a long shadow cast adjacent to it. Say you had a pole, which cast this\nshadow. If I were to take the length of the pole, and do this:\n\nC^2=l(d / r)/Y\n\n-where C^2 is the width and length of the world, and l is the length, d represents the distance of the shadow to the pole, r represents the fractional disambiguator, and Y is\na constant. By putting values into these calculations, I have spent quite some hours scrawling out the output of the equation onto my chamber's floors. This shows, effectively, that the size of the world is never-ending in either direction. This could\nessentially make truth of the postulation of Angels and Demons, while this is a bid ludicrous, it does narrow our choices down and completely abolishes the idea of 'spherical worlds'.", ""),
        StaticBook("worth", "BaronVonDietz", "Speek the password azador and the gate shall open", ""),
        StaticBook("WR Pass Template", "vulcus", "   ~*Proof of Sanctity*~\n\nName:\n~\nRace:\n~\nHair color:\n~\nPass level: (I or II)\n~\nOther notes:\n\n~~                                ~~\nThis document contains transit validity for Rose Pass.\n\nThe holder of this sublime document shall be exempt from taxation and harm while passing through Rose and Chivay lands, by will of the Creator, the Emperor and those lands' respective lords.\n\n~\nShould the owner of this document require further information, they must speak with the one who assigned it, or otherwise an officer within the White Roses.\n\nSigned,\n\nJohn Stu\nWhite Rose Ensign\n\n~                                  ~\nNote:\n\nThe ownership of this pass applies solely to <XYZ>. Should this document come under the control of another, this pass will be null and void.\n\n~*Proof of Sanctity*~\n\n((template notes ->))\n((Pass level indicates the importance of the pass and the person it was issued to.  Level One (I) seemingly means a random cunt, such as a merchant or a noble diplomat, requires basic, free passage through Rose territory. Level Two (II) indicates a noble-\n-man or noblewoman, a king, or a member of the Emperor's family, and so on.  It's pretty easy to tell them apart. Try not to change too much from this template to avoid having 999 types of passports. Keep the original feel. Don't include any OOC shit.-Che", ""),
        StaticBook("Wrath of Time", "Pinsir99", "     Wrath Of Time\n\nTime: The greatest illusion. Man-made, everlasting, impossible to see through.\n\nAs the universe progresses things change, our minds view such as time againg all.\n\nTo those who ask how\ntime affects us even though it is an illusion, I ask. If everyone sees, feels and believes that something exists, does it not exist?\n\nThe illusion is built to weaken, wither and destroy. All minda see it, all minds are intertwined by it.\nIf the illusion is is pressed foward on the living, it will decay, then die, its tissue becoming stone then turning to dust.\n\nOn the metal, it will weaken, then rust, becoming so weak it can not hold itself.\n\nTime is an unforgiving\nand ruthless illusion that we can not avoid.\n\nWhat is changed in the illusion is changed in reality. When the illusion is warped to age one to stone, the individual's own mind sees itself turn to stone.\n\nTo be able to warp\nsuch an illusion- time, is the work of gods, of legends. The individual that unlocks the mystery of time will be known among all.\n\n-Tahjeet Mubdee\n\nCopied by Aerius Adurond\n", ""),
        StaticBook("WTF!? FOUND THIS", "InfernoLizard", "Laenry's Second Journal\n===================This journal was made to record my findings in alchemy. It contains my most prised creations, and steps on how to produce them.\nNight Root Poison\n===================A potion I discovered through unfortunate situations, this mix of one part Tippin's Root and two parts Night Sap creates a long lasting paralysis effect when ingested.\nMethod\n===================1. Crush Tippin's Root until fine.\n2. Add powder to boiling water, making sure there are no clusters.\n3. Stir in Night Sap until mixture is golden.\n4. Bottle and prepare for use or storage.\nCrippled Penis Wrangler\n=====================\nNot much is known about this creature, but that it is a byproduct of lychomanty.  Upon becoming a lych, you dick will fall of and crawl away quickly.  Good luck finding that bitch once it's gone.\nMeth\n======================1. Become lich\n2. Capture your free willing dick\n3. PROFIT??", ""),
        StaticBook("ya", "Queen Katherine Carrion", "ya ok adopt ok", ""),
        StaticBook("Yana's Diary 1", "Tristanm1", "Entry\n\nOkay, so here I go starting a diary. I'm Yana. I'm 8. I live with my Dad in his keep.\n\nI guess I should go over everything until now. So, it all started when my Mom came to visit. I wasn't too happy. She had\nabandoned me, or so I thought. Mom told me that she had been kept away, and pretty much as soon as she did, half the keep came to pull me away from my mom and chase her away. She was right! I was mad. Muramasa held me back. I'll talk about him more later.\nAfter tha, I went and hid in the cookie-pie tavern for awhile until Alistier found me.  He took me to visit my mom secretly. It was good.  Mom promised she wouldn't leave, and she hasn't it just got really hard before we got to now. The second time I came\nto visit mom, Muramasa found us and made trouble... Mom got killed then. They weren't going to let me see mom after that. so Alistier tried to take me to her, but everyone else chased us away. I was mad, but Daniel promised to be unbanish my mom if I was \nnice to him, and he did! So now mom can come visit whenever, and she has twice! Dad has started being nicer too, and he's brought home some friends for me, like Layla. We did some archery today. I got two right in the heart!\n\nI think that's it.\nEntry\n\nEveryone's being really nice to me today. First, Bellona gave me some cake, then Alistier and Bellona gave me a book. I dunno why. Because they wanted to?\n\nI'm gonna go read.\nAdded\n\nLayla came up while I was reading. She had found an egg! We dropped it, though...\n\nAnyway, then Mordie came and he wanted to scare Layla, so we made jokes about him a bit and then he cried, so I gave him my last\ncookie. I hope he cheers up.\nEntry\n\nDad died. I don't know how. Mom says he was kidnapping and picking fights with Uncle Edmund.\n\nMom's staying here now. She says she's not going away this time. I hope she's not.\nI hope Layla stays too...\nAddition\n\nWow, that was cool! Back to the beginning...\n\nI was still really sad so Alistier decided to take me to Salvus. I wasn't too excited, but then I met Art. He said something about me having a mushroom cousin Ivan. After \ntalking to him, he took me and Alistier to the Delvers. There, he showed us around and it was AMAZING. We even got to meet Ivan the mushroom! I don't know if we're related, but he seemed friendly enough. Art said I can come back anytime, and Alistier says\nI can go back with supervision, so... soon! I can't wait!\nEntry\n\nToday's my birthday! I'm 9 now!\n\nSo, today Alistier and Mom took me to the Delvers. I got to read some cool magic books and visit Ivan. This really tall elf with blue hair showed us a glowing tree and\ntalked about golems. I learned a lot today, and it was fun.\nEntry\n\nAlistier died, but a monk saved him. Why does keep dying?\nEntry\n\nI haven't written in awhile...\n\nMom left. Someone's trying to kill her. She wanted me to come with, but Uncle Edmund won't let her, so... I don't get to have any parents...\nEntry\n\nMom's back to stay! And I have a brother! Somewhere... I'm kinda hungry...", ""),
        StaticBook("Ye Olde", "MagusArcanus", "Olde Magic Vol I.\n```````````````````````````\nCompiled by\nOdin Hrafnblodt\n\nForeword: My various studies of old sagas and runestones have shown me glimpses of lost knowledge. These glimpses I have recorded within this book and others.\nSiren Song\n\nIncantation: \"Come sleep with me. I'll set you free. Come dream with me... At the bottom of the North sea.\"\n\nEffects: Vivid hallucination of female shapes and sounds. Great fear is caused by this.\n\nHex of Wakefullness\n\nIncantation: \"Raabin'tagul ra gin tahaar'a, raabin'tagul ra gin kal'karaa. So'khor baro metis, pen'taro bah'kar zaqhur!\"\n\nEffects: Innability to fall asleep. Confusion.\nJinx of Unsteady Feet\n\nIncantation: \"Sine Peribus, in terra ligare!\"\n\nEffects: Large amounts of dizziness, innability to run, difficulty walking, vomiting.\n\n\n\nButterface Curse\n\nIncantation: \"Pudgy, soft, fat. This is what you will now become. By my power and might, I curse thee.\"\n\nEffects: Makes target extremely ugly temporarily. Causes wart growth, and growth of cartilege.\nHex of Rough Waves\n\nIncantation: \"Fram og til baka oldurnar fara, til og fra.\"\n\nEffects: Makes all forms of water near the target less hospitable and more stormy. Also makes it less easy to gain good wind in the sails.\nThe Children's Curse\n\nIncantation: \"One upon a time, we sat all together, rocking on the swing, merrily merrily... merrily merrily...\"\n\nEffects: Induces a profound sense of terror and hallucination in target.\n((OOC: This book was written with the intention of creating interesting RP scenarios, not with the intention of breaking lore. Please understand this, and try to have fun using the incantations in the book in a sensible, consensual manner.))", ""),
        StaticBook("Yorhahn's Hill.", "1st edition press.", "-(*Yorhahns Hill*)-\n\n\n                /|\n               //\n           __//\n         / __+}\n         |+|   o\\\n        [X]    | }\n          {@@]-|\n         {@@@w\n =================\n           \n~Once upon a time~\n\n\nThere was a village known as Nar-Yahn. (Meaning \"Hill City\")\n\nThis town was erected behind a large west facing hill, that kept the cold western winds from freezing the town.\nNow - upon the town, was stowed a great deal of riches and treasure. As the residents were prudent and strong, and were propserperous in all they did.\n\nSadly, this attracted bandits and brigands, and all matters of -\n - unsavory folk.\n\nTo keep the brigands at bay - men would sit atop the large hill to keep watch, and to deter any bandits that dared think of harming the town.\n\nAfter many failed attempts all bandits stopped attacking.\n And for many years, the village lived in peace, and had many parties and festivals.\n\nNow - on the festivals. the guards were given a time off, and usually someone would volunteer to keep watch.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n   Among those was             Yorhahn.\n Yorhahn was a short, and skinny boy. (No taller than a meter and a half's length)\n\nHe had snow white skin (As all Signus do) and kind blue eyes (A rare trait for a Signus)\n\nHe volunteered on the festival of Suns to keep watch.\nLater - and later, Yorhahn continued to volunteer for the guards, eventually to the point he missed every single party and festival.\n\nSoon, many of the guards asked Yorhahn to simply cover them whilst they took a day off.\n ~+_         \n             ___\n           /     \\\n           |       | ~+_\n           \\___/\n     ~+_\n=================\nYorhahn was glad\n        to.\n=================\n   ___\n  /\\  |    ___\n  |E|++|  /\\   |\nYorhahn became a regular watchman, yet unpaid, unarmed, and jobless - Yorhahn had to have support from his friends and family.\n\n\nGladly, they gave it to him.\n  \n              /|\n             //\n         __//\n       / __+}\n       |+|XXX|\n      [X]XXX|\n\n\n===================\n A horned helm from          his father.\n=================\n             /\\\n             |  |\n             |  |\n             |  |\n             |  |    \n             |  |\n             |  |                        ~q~p~\n             []\n===================A sword from his  \n        mother\n==================\n  \n\n\n             /\\|/\n              _w_\n            XXXXX\n           XXXXXX\n            XXXXX\n            \n==================\nA pouch from his\n      brother\n==================\n   \n\n\n           ~-~\n\n\n\n===================And a night in bed with his lover\n===================\nYorhahn, equipped and happy, stood guard for nights on end. Eating only when good was given, and resting only with his lover.\n\nDays became weeks, weeks became months, and months became years.\nSlowly, slowly, the guards stopped keeping watch, leaving Yorhahn alone on the hill.\n\nYorhahn would stant atop the hill, a staunch sentinel.\n\nHe stood upon the hill for over 35 years, never resting-\n- rarely eating, and almost never blinking even.\n\nOne day though  \n(on the festival of Suns)\n\nMany brigands and bandits came together, noting that only one man stood watch over Nar-Yahn.\nThe brigands decided they would raid Nar-yahn once and for all.\n\nSo they amassed a large army of 1000 men, and marched upon the hill of Nar-yahn.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n       But Yorhahn\n     stood guard.\nOne by one - the brigands fell to Yorhahn's sword, the blue-eyed northerner ignoring any and all wounds.\n\nNone heard the battle, nor saw it happen. As all in the village were busy drinking and partying and making love.\n And just as Yorhahn struck down the last brigand, he fell down upon his back. 9 arrows having pierced his arm, and 12 slashes across his belly, Yorhahn had managed to survive.\n\nAfter the festival ended, a woman looked up upon the hill -\n - and noticed corpses and bodies littering it's snowy slope.\n\nQuickly - the woman rushed up to see Yorhahn, only to find him on the ground, bleeding.\n\nThe woman cried out in despair of Yorhahn's demise, and she begged him to curse the guards whose slothfulness had caused his end.\n\nYet Yorhahn was happy.\nHe told the woman that he had fulfilled his job. To keep watch over the hill, so that the guards may rest.\n\n\nAnd with that, Yorhahn leaned back his head, and his soul was released from his heart.", ""),
        StaticBook("York to Carrion.", "bickando", "Penned by the hand of\nPrince Siegmund Carrion\n\nThe Betrothal of Andrew York, heir to Ager, to the niece of Prince Siegmund Carrion\n\nThis document signifies the confirmation, legal binding, and responsib\nility of Lord Darek York, Count of Ager, to consent to the matrilinear marriage of his heir and son, Andrew York, to niece of Prince Carrion.\n\nWith this, the county of Ager will return to Corpathia, reuniting the duchy under rule of kingdom of Savoie\nSigned\nCrown Prince Siegmund Carrion, Duke of Raev amongst other titles...\n\nSigned\nLord Darek Althered, Count of Ager amongst other titles...\n\n", ""),
        StaticBook("You're SPECIAL!", "Caelria", "S is for Strength, that means I am strong! I can carry lots of toys and swing stuff all day long!\nP is for Perception, a long funny word! It means what I tasted, smell, saw and heard!\nE is for Endurance, and that's how long I can play! I'm always really healthy, and have energy all day!\nC is for Charisma, it's why people think I'm great! I make my friends all laugh and smile, and never want to hate!\nI is for Intelligence, it means I'm really smart! I use my brain for lots of stuff, like science, math and art!\nA is for Agility, that's how I get around! I move real fast and easy, and I never make a sound!\nL is for Luck, and it's simple, you see! It means that good things always happen to me!", ""),
        StaticBook("You, t", "[Face Bandaged] Jesea Rousseau", "  ~-You, the Dark-~\nDark, She is the mind of yours. \nIcy chill of thought becomes \nA steely shimmer.\nBehold a glimmer in the black - \nA flash of grey, that even glows \nIn show against the hallowed dark of you. \n\n\nAnd that is why you scream in jarring tones\n'I have no heart for joy! \nMy white and brittle bones have died'\nYou cried in dark and fractured moans.\n\n\nSo now the Queen of Black you writhe, \nWhence from dark of shade\nThat honed an evil form afar; \nIn curse of me you bade: \n\n'I, the wave shall hit the shore! \nViolence will there be in glares I'll throw\nAt all who prey, and more: \nA dark and fetid sea I'll bleed.'\n\nAnd now, the bitter tinge\nAnd bleak of waste\nThat eyed the death of once your soul\nWill here forever be! \n\nIndeed you tell: \n 'The cramping pain is here! \n\n\nEternal spasm, infinite chasm, \nThe Devil's chaplain plays! \nWe'll climax in a tortured glee\nAs all my love decays.'\n\n", ""),
