        StaticBook("Writable Book", "", "§9§n§l Guard Journal \n§r\n§0This Journal Belongs to\n\n§8§oMullraugh P. Hoxton\n\n\n\n\n\nThe Following Entries Are For The Year Of\n1451.\n\n§n16th of First Seed\n§r\n\n§lGate Duty:\n§r§8§oNothing to Report.\n\n§0§lPatrol:\n§r§8§l§r§8§oNothing to Report.\n\n§o§0§o§0§lNotes:\n§l§8§l§r§8§oGroup of Dwarves were chased off by the King's Men.\n\n§r§n17th of First Seed\n§r\n\n§0§lGate Duty:\n§8§oNothing to Report.\n\n§0§o§l§r§0§lPatrol:\n§r§8§l§r§8§oNothing to Report.\n\n§l§r§0§lNotes:\n§0§8§l§8§oAcosta Family now wanted. Reason still unknown to me.\n\n§0§n1st of Sun's Smile\n§r\n\n§0§lGate Duty:\n§8§oNothing to Report.\n\n§0§lPatrol:\n§o§8§oNothing to Report.\n\n§p§0§lNotes:\n§8§l§8§8§oNothing to Report.\n\n§n2nd of Sun's Smile\n\n§r\n§lGate Duty:\n§8§oNothing to Report.\n\n§0§lPatrol:\n§8§oRan into a heretic at the tavern. Was dealt with swiftly.\n§0§lNotes:\n§8§oNothing to report.\n\n§n4th of Sun's Smile\n\n§0§l\nGate Duty:\n§8§oLet the king in the city. Nothing else to Report.\n§0§lPatrol:\n§8§oNothing to Report\n\n§0§lNotes:\n§8§oNothing to Report\n\n§n5th of Sun's Smile\n\n§r§0§l\nGate Duty:\n§8§oNothing to Report\n\n§0§lPatrol:\n§8§oNothing to Report\n\n§0§lNotes:\n§l§0§8§oNothing to Report", ""),
