        StaticBook("Writable Book", "", "<*> Residency of Darkhaven <*>\n\n<*>The Dark Trinity<*>\nThe Klarens:\n-Goroth Klaren [Lego_XBOX]\n- Ishabellya Klaren [Lego_XBOX]\n-\n\nThe Shadeleaf:\n- Sathoro Shadeleaf [Balluffip]\n- Selestia Shadeleaf [Xiryks]\n\nThe Nighthearts:\n- Rhea Nightheart [MrGoldd]\n\n<*>The Isttel's:<*>\n-Ahlysaaria (Rexx8)\n-Ahlystin (sharkali)\n-Belaern (77minerman)\n-Veldryn (crayfishchris)\n-Velkyn (V01TAG3)\n--Elerra (moosehunter123)\n\n<*>The Raven'kor's:<*>\n-Kaldo (Mthdominator)\n-Faervel (Tilly13)\n-Cynli (CounterFactual)\n-Solan (Elite117)\n-Lilith (Desires)\n\n<*>The Oussana’s:<*>\n-Khel (Baconthief)\n-Z’ress (JadeKadoa)\n-Limith (Samsan99)\n-Dalninil (kizumachan)\n-Linthel (sharkali)", ""),
