        StaticBook("Writable Book", "", "Rise of the King of Anthos.\n\nIntroduction:\n \n  For years I have studied the political structure of several unique governents in both Anthos and Asulon. All of these nations are focused around what seems to be the rich getting richer and the lowly serfs and peasants\n\ngetting poorer.", ""),
