        StaticBook("A letter", "YourFriendEarl", "Dear General Store Owner,\n\nHail and good wishings upon you and your shop. My name is Earl, a recent visitor to your shop in Abresi. At the time I was not looking for goods to purchase but now I am. I am inquiring if you have a bow for sale\n\nas well as any quiver of arrows. To be exact I am looking for 20 arrows and one bow. Please reply to my mailbox stating if you own these items and they are for sale. \nSincerely,\n\nEarl of Kralta", ""),
        StaticBook("A Reply", "TheCleaningCrew", "Earl,\nYes, we have both a bow and arrows for sale! Come by when the shop is open and we can get those to you. I'm thinking 30 minas.\n               -Gooms", ""),
        StaticBook("Pumkin Permit", "Chumpchump", "Pumpkin Head Permit\n------------------\nThe holder of this permit, Gooms, is permitted to have a pumpkin as a head unmolested. We don't want to know what's under it.\n\n*Imperial Seal*", ""),
        StaticBook("Writable Book", "", "~_~_~_~_~_~_~_~       The Codex\n            Of\n       The Pants\n         Knights\n~_~_~_~_~_~_~_~\n\n     ----------\n     I    ____    I\n     I   I      I    I\n     I   I      I    I\n     I   I      I    I\n     I   I      I    I\n\nThe pages are blank...as if they await a new writer to fill in the pages...\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~The pants knights shall bring peace and love to the world. People make love without pants. People cant make war without pants. We will steal all pants.\n\nVirtues of the order\n~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~All pants knights shall steal as many pants as possible. The population is not fit to wear them.", ""),
