        StaticBook("Testing Rules", "§bonm224", "RULES\n\n1. Before testing anything, please you need someone watching you from outside the testing chamber. NEVER test ALONE!.\n2. Now that you are in, please make shure you are standing right in the middle of the plataform\n3. Now, as you can see\n\nthere is a trapdoor just in top of you. Open it, and make shure that when you jump, your head touches the water.\n4. Once you've tested your chemical, if it has any effect, please record it on a book and leave that book in the Alchemy teacher's office.\n\nWritten by: Amras Lúinwë", ""),
        StaticBook("Why do you fight", "Caelria", "For what is it you fight?\n\nA man wandered into our city today, famished and wounded. He claimed to be a White Rose.\n\nWe fed him and tended to his needs, and he left alive and safe. Are we evil?", ""),
