        StaticBook("Glowing Letter", "RHcrow", "*A letter arrives\nin an envelope glowing with light.\n\nThe writing inside glows with a faint orange glow*\n\n\nCaptain,\n\nI have another task that I think will be more suited for your crew.  \nA simple transportation job would be an insult to your capabilities.\n\nI will be down by the docks in a few minutes to speak.\n\n-The Red", ""),
        StaticBook("A Note and Minas", "TheCleaningCrew", "I would like to purchase two bottles of the advertised. \"Hot Sauce.\" The minas owed are in the pouch on the bird's leg.\n                 -Gooms", ""),
        StaticBook("Writable Book", "", "I was traveling to Abresi when I noticed a large fireball headed  Southwest.\n\nMoments later I heard a loud blast toward Baile.  I made my way there to be met by a small crowd.\n\nI approached the city gates to see the city\n\nInside to be in flames.\n\nI scoured the foothills for a better glimpse  of what the destruction deep within the city looked like as the gates were all locked.", ""),
